@startuml mo_sos_elections
title mo_sos_elections: Missouri SoS official election returns (PDFs)
start
:Results page sos.mo.gov/elections/results:
every "Grand Totals" link under a General or Primary
Election heading (Aug 2012 on);
note right: one shard unit per election (one PDF)
:fetch one PDF at a time (2 s delay, cached);
:pdfplumber words -> lines (by top edge);
:structure only: contest header (contest_seq),
candidate row cells (name | party | votes | %) by column x,
total / party total lines;
note right: every line lands, with pdf_url, page and line
:mo_sos_election_rows;
:dbt staging: lines -> contests, results, printed_totals;
:dbt marts: fct_election_races (margin, uncontested)
and fct_judicial_retention (Yes %);
stop
@enduml
